        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Reguitti SDK092PV/PA Modern Square Double Pocket Door Lock Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nVery modern square shape double pocket door privacy lock set that offers high fashion and high quality function. Packaged as a complete set that includes the privacy mortise lock body, two (2) square flush pulls for lock, two (2) square flush pulls for non locking door, two (2) square edge pulls, a strike plate and all mounting hardware. Made in Italy by Reguitti.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in high quality finishes and for both <b>1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" thick double pocket doors</b>. The edge pull is pressure mounted into the door's edge and the square flush pulls are pressure mounted into the door's face.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via an emergency turn. A privacy lock does not offer security, it offers privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available for single pocket doors: \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-square-pocket-lock-privacy-reguitti-sdk092pv\"><b>Modern Square  Pocket Lock Privacy</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-square-pocket-door-passage-set-reguitti-sdk092pa\"><b>Modern Square  Pocket Door Pull Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe privacy mortise lock is installed on one door. The strike plate is installed on the other door. When locked, the two pocket doors are hooked tightly together. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SDK092PV/PA Modern Square Pocket Lock Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Height: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Body Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Faceplate Height: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Total Height:  2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Total Width:  2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Total Depth: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Door Cutout Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Privacy Trim Projection:  3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Door Cutout Diameter: 1-7/8\" (48 mm)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/contemporary-square-fingertip-edge-pull-ahi-ep1273\">Square Edge Pull</a>: 1-1/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK092PV.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK092PV/PA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDK091PV-SDK092PV-template.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>SDK092PV Instalation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on double (french) pocket sliding doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note:</b> The inside thumb turn <b>project 3/16\" off the door's face</b>. If you intend to use on a <b>pocket door</b>, please insure that you have <b>more than 3/16\" clearance</b> between the door's face and the wall pocket.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> privacy mortise lock body, two (2) Square flush pulls for lock, two (2) Square flush pulls for non locking door, two (2) square edge pulls, strike plate and all mounting hardware. <b>For One Pair of Pocket Doors. (2 doors)</b>\r\n</p>",
